# Creative Canvas V1 — Local Issues

## CCV1-01 — Canonical product and technical documents

**Status:** completed

Record the approved boundary, model, APIs, safety model, and compatibility policy; preserve prior specs as history.

## CCV1-02 — Workflow contracts and additive migration

**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CCV1-01

Add discriminated workflow nodes, typed connections, recipes, plans, ChangeSets, collection items, and SQLite tables.

## CCV1-03 — Revisioned workflow graph service

**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CCV1-02

Implement snapshots, legacy import, command validation, atomic mutation, port checking, and cycle prevention.

## CCV1-04 — Recipe registry and execution planning

**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CCV1-03

Add built-in capabilities, recipe CRUD, subgraph planning, topological order, and execution state.

## CCV1-05 — Real image provider adapter

**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CCV1-02

Implement configurable OpenAI Images generation/editing, provider errors, references/masks, and durable outputs.

## CCV1-06 — Mixed-node canvas UI

**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CCV1-03, CCV1-04

Render artifact and recipe nodes, typed ports, recipe palette, layout, selection planning, and execution shelf.

## CCV1-07 — Text Studio

**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CCV1-03

Add Markdown editing/preview, autosave, revision conflict handling, and canvas navigation.

## CCV1-08 — Image generation and candidate workflow

**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CCV1-04, CCV1-05

Add prompts/references, candidate collections, compare/select/download, and lineage.

## CCV1-09 — Mask, outpaint, and enhancement

**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CCV1-08

Add mask drawing/import, expansion, validation, outpaint, variation, and enhancement.

## CCV1-10 — Internal agent proposal review

**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CCV1-03

Implement ChangeSet proposal, validation, review, approval, rejection, and stale handling.

## CCV1-11 — Read-only MCP proposal surface

**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CCV1-10

Expose snapshot, validation, proposal, and status tools with no approval or execution.

## CCV1-12 — Hardening and release gates

**Status:** completed
**Depends on:** CCV1-05, CCV1-06, CCV1-07, CCV1-08, CCV1-09, CCV1-10, CCV1-11

Add contract, migration, service, route, UI, provider, and end-to-end tests; verify build, limits, errors, and legacy compatibility.
